      "title": "File:German WW2 Kriegsmarine Admiral's pennant; embroidery of Schlachtschiff Scharnhorst. Lofoten Krigsminnemuseum, Norway 2019-05-08 DSC09976.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/German_WW2_Kriegsmarine_Admiral%27s_pennant%3B_embroidery_of_Schlachtschiff_Scharnhorst._Lofoten_Krigsminnemuseum%2C_Norway_2019-05-08_DSC09976.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
