      "title": "File:German WW2 Kriegsmarine Schlachtschiff Scharnhorst sailor's cap (Tellermütze). Lofoten Krigsminnemuseum, Svolvær, Norway (War Memorial Museum) 2019-05-08 DSC09979.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/German_WW2_Kriegsmarine_Schlachtschiff_Scharnhorst_sailor%27s_cap_%28Tellerm%C3%BCtze%29._Lofoten_Krigsminnemuseum%2C_Svolv%C3%A6r%2C_Norway_%28War_Memorial_Museum%29_2019-05-08_DSC09979.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
